<title>USA: March Ill. riverboat revenues down from March '96.</title>
<headline>March Ill. riverboat revenues down from March '96.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Illinois riverboats grossed more than $97.16 million in March, down from the nearly $111.35 million taken in March 1996, according to the state gaming board's monthly report.</p>
<p>The riverboats took in $9.51 million more last month than they did in February, the gaming board reported.</p>
<p>((--David Bailey, 312-408-8647))</p>
</text>
